This records one local build. Other targets and linkers produce different hashes.
Registry source paths under /Users/booko/.cargo are embedded, so another CARGO_HOME
does too. The checkout and target directory do not change it.
bin/install-outlook-intake.sh installs the decoder only when its build matches line 1.
After refreshing line 1, run `python3 ops/hxprobe-source-digest.py --write`; CI fails a
crate, atlas, or atlas generator change whose Source digest line is stale.
